 offers the strength and performance you need.<br\/><br\/><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$5.08\/sq ft.<\/strong><\/em><br\/><br\/>Perfect for <strong>high-traffic areas<\/strong> like <strong>arenas<\/strong>, <strong>professional fitness center <\/strong>or a <strong>home gym.<\/strong><\/p>","button_label":"BUY Stamina Gym Flooring","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/stamina-gym-flooring"}},"template--14486398664833__615e1875-70c7-4048-b965-406b3987482c-1678122865fdbed3f5-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ProXL.png","image_width":650,"title":"PRO-XL FLOORING","text":"<p><strong>Unparalleled Durability and Performance<\/strong><\/p><p>Designed to be a long-lasting, high-performance floor that's versatile and anti-slip. <\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$12.92\/sq ft.<br\/><br\/><\/strong><\/em>Perfect for <strong>Sport Courts, Ice Rinks & Fitness Facilities<\/strong> (Marble Finish)<\/p>","button_label":"BUY PRO-XL FLOORING","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/proxl-gym-flooring"}},"template--14486398664833__615e1875-70c7-4048-b965-406b3987482c-1678122865fdbed3f5-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/JL3A7612_15.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"RE-ACTION FLOORING","text":"<p><strong>Unparalleled Resilience and Traction<\/strong><\/p><p>Shock-absorbing, dual-layer, non-porous design for intense athletes and environments.<\/p><p><em>Starting at <\/em><em><strong>$23.04\/sq ft.<br\/><br\/><\/strong><\/em>Perfect for <strong>Sport Courts, Ice Rinks & Fitness Facilities<\/strong> (Speckled Finish)<\/p>","button_label":"BUY RE-ACTION FLOORING","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/reaction-gym-flooring-1"}}},"block_order":["template--14486398664833__615e1875-70c7-4048-b965-406b3987482c-1678122865fdbed3f5-0","template--14486398664833__615e1875-70c7-4048-b965-406b3987482c-1678122865fdbed3f5-1","template--14486398664833__615e1875-70c7-4048-b965-406b3987482c-1678122865fdbed3f5-2"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"39a763ee-c278-4232-a5e1-778ac95493cc":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"template--14491775238273__39a763ee-c278-4232-a5e1-778ac95493cc-1686171766b958953f-1":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><\/th>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0041\/9672\/8961\/files\/vulcanized_products.png?v=1686064408\" alt=\"Vulcanized Products\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px;\">Vulcanized Products<\/th>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0041\/9672\/8961\/files\/urethane_bound.png?v=1686064408\" alt=\"Urethane Bound Products\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px;\">Urethane Bound Products<\/th>\n    <\/tr>\n  <\/thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0041\/9672\/8961\/files\/durability.png?v=1685465529\" alt=\"Durability\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px;\">\n  Durability\n<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Hard wearing and durable<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">With heavy\/continuous use product deteriorates<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0041\/9672\/8961\/files\/porosity.png?v=1685465530\" alt=\"Porosity\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px;\">Porosity<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Does not absorb liquid<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Liquids (water, perspiration, sport drinks) absorb into pores between rubber particles<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0041\/9672\/8961\/files\/finish_sealers.png\" alt=\"Finish\/Sealers\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px;\">Finish\/Sealers<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Not required<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Required to close pores from absorbing liquids<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0041\/9672\/8961\/files\/maintenance.png?v=1685465529\" alt=\"Maintenance\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px;\">Maintenance<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Smooth top surface makes mopping\/cleaning easy<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Rough\/porous top makes cleaning more difficult - mops 'stick' to it<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0041\/9672\/8961\/files\/cleanliness.png?v=1685465529\" alt=\"Cleanliness\" style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 10px;\">Cleanliness<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Does not harbour bacteria<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">Porous surface allows bacteria to penetrate and spread<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n   <\/tbody>\n<\/table>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--14491775238273__39a763ee-c278-4232-a5e1-778ac95493cc-1686171766b958953f-1"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":false}},"3a67397c-174a-4be3-863e-63170b093e69":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14491775238273__3a67397c-174a-4be3-863e-63170b093e69-1686172277952aa2fb-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/vulcanized_gym_floor.png","image_width":650,"title":"What is Vulcanization?","text":"<p>Vulcanization is the process of transforming raw rubber into a durable cured material through cross-linking of polymer chains under high heat and pressure.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14491775238273__3a67397c-174a-4be3-863e-63170b093e69-1686172277952aa2fb-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/vulcanization.jpg","image_width":650,"title":"How is Vulcanized Flooring Made?","text":"<p>End-of-life tires are recycled into tire crumb rubber, which is molded and vulcanized under high heat and pressure to create the final product.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14491775238273__3a67397c-174a-4be3-863e-63170b093e69-1686172277952aa2fb-0","template--14491775238273__3a67397c-174a-4be3-863e-63170b093e69-1686172277952aa2fb-1"],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"text_and_image_rdx3dh":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Gym_Turf_1.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"perfect for commercial use","title":"Portable Indoor Padded Turf for Multi-Sport","text":"<p>Convert any indoor area into a versatile sports practice field with the Portable Indoor Padded Turf. <br\/><br\/>G-MAX tested and designed for durability, this roll-out turf is ideal for soccer, football, baseball, and more. Simple to set up and store, it provides a reliable, safe surface for training throughout the year, regardless of the weather.<\/p>","button_label":"buy Portable Indoor Padded Turf","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/portable-indoor-padded-turf-for-multi-sport","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text_columns_iDichF":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_PEEAnK":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Gym_Turf_1.png","image_width":550,"title":"Portable Indoor Padded Turf for Multi-Sport"