eft","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text_and_image_HNhzid":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/NWR.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Built for Performance & Durability","title":"Stamina Gym Flooring","text":"<p>Perfect for <strong>high-traffic areas<\/strong> like arenas and gyms, Stamina delivers lasting durability and resilience. <br\/><br\/>Whether you're outfitting a professional fitness center or a home gym, this flooring offers the strength and performance you need.<br\/><\/p>","button_label":"Buy Stamina Gym Flooring","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/stamina-gym-flooring","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text_and_image_3E6pVQ":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/titan_2_32366887-ec6c-49bf-9176-4d2f10583766.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"Premium Rubber Flooring","title":"Titan Gym Tiles 4 Pack","text":"<p>Crafted with vulcanization technology, Titan Premium Rubber Flooring offers unbeatable durability, resisting wear, tear, and moisture. <br\/><br\/>The 4' x 6' mat features a tight interlocking design and heavyweight build, allowing for quick, adhesive-free installation. <br\/><\/p>","button_label":"Buy Titan Gym Tiles 4 Pack","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/titan-premium-rubber-gym-tiles-4-pack","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"57169a6f-abbd-4633-965a-f6fbcffc3d23":{"type":"text-and-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/NWR_2.png","image_width":450,"subtitle":"","title":"Heavy-impact absorption","text":"<p>Protect your flooring from dropped weights and heavy equipment. Gym flooring tiles create the perfect environment for maximum performance.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"le